  "notes": "Dominant identifiers embed Ref, Floor where applicable, Spread, optional Cash + PIK, Total Coupon, and Maturity Date/Maturity. Percent fields are stated with percent signs and should be converted as pct values. No borrower-level aggregation is proposed."
